tinker_cookbook.distillation.train_on_policy:201 [INFO] <|im_system|>system<|im_middle|>You are Kimi, an AI assistant created by Moonshot AI.<|im_end|><|im_user|>user<|im_middle|>Describe the perfect setting for a massage.<|im_end|><|im_assistant|>assistant<|im_middle|><think></think>Oh, you know, you want that sweet spot where your brain finally stops reminding you about emails you forgot to send. For me, it's a dim room with some warm, low light—nothing harsh, maybe a few candles if you're feeling fancy. Temperature's gotta be just right, like a lazy Sunday morning under the covers, not that awkward "did someone forget to pay the heating bill?" chill.

Background noise? A little rain sounds or something earthy, but keep it soft enough that it doesn't become a whole thing you're actively listening to. Someplace between "spa day" and "accidentally fell asleep on the couch."

And the table, man—warm, clean sheets that don't smell like a hospital. Maybe a hint of eucalyptus or lavender drifting around, nothing that punches you in the nose. 

Honestly? The perfect setting is mostly just... nobody bugging you. Phone in another room. No clocks in sight. You lose track of whether you've been there twenty minutes or two hours. That's the real magic—when time just... wanders off somewhere. That's when you know they got it right.<|im_end|>
